collision episodes analysed : 391  (CollisionHuman=336, CollisionObs=50, CollisionWall=5)
CAVEAT: replay is exact for the COLLIDING pedestrian when it is non-reactive; other
  reactive pedestrians (17.6% of the population) would in reality have responded to the
  counterfactual robot motion. Their recorded paths are used as-is. State this in the paper.

horizon    NON-REACTIVE humans (exact)  reactive (approximate)      
0.5 s      14/385 inevitable (3.6%)     3/6 inevitable (50.0%)      
